<title>USA: Sabine Royalty sets monthly distribution.</title>
<headline>Sabine Royalty sets monthly distribution.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sabine Royalty Trust said it declared a monthly distribution of $0.12408 per unit.</p>
<p>The distribution is payable June 30, to holders of record on June 16.</p>
<p>The prior distribution paid by the trust was $0.14383 per unit on April 29.</p>
</text>
